a5166429af9aab6c1468539589ecf583b6c30`\n\n### Validation and execution\n\nSelected CallerA successor and retained CallerB both validated successfully, with **9 expanded VM nodes each**. CallerB\u2019s validation plan identity remains unchanged.\n\n| Root | Input hex | Observed result | Failure label / offset |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| CallerA successor | `0a14` | **43**, UInt16BE `002b` | \u2014 |\n| CallerA successor | `64c8` | **403**, UInt16BE `0193` | \u2014 |\n| CallerA successor | `0a13` | `WINDOW_NARROW` | `c_width` / 0 |\n| CallerA successor | `c8c9` | `END_CAP` | `c_cap` / 1 |\n| CallerA successor | `c8c900` | `TRAILING` | `input_end` / 2 |\n| CallerB retained | `14` | **60**, UInt16BE `003c` | \u2014 |\n| CallerB retained | `15` | `WINDOW_NARROW` | `c_width` / 0 |\n| CallerB retained | `a1` | `END_CAP` | `c_cap` / 0 |\n| CallerB retained | `a100` | `TRAILING` | `input_end` / 1 |\n\nThese executions confirm the changed CallerA result, unchanged CallerB behavior, cap-before-width failure precedence, and end-of-input rejection before composition. All rejection results are preserved above; no admission, migration, retrieval, or validation call failed.", "time": {"start": 1791575985438, "end": 1791575999813}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "msg_09f28af6fb4ea5a3016ac947b25b5087d0a3b7e8a93ed28d53", "phase": "final_answer"}}}}
